From a07b138cc7fe1781a598a915f991dd25cc475e11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prateek <prateekxd15@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:54:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] fix(clips): 17 s minimum, white seam captions, title
 on/off, layout picker; gaming layout wins over Fit

- Reverts 1cdd8c6 (forcing the non-direct render for layout templates
  rendered source-time EDL segments on the trimmed intermediate: 3-8 s
  clips). Instead, a chosen layout template with a facecam found
  delegates the clip to the plain path in the reframe planner, whatever
  the framing; build_vertical_filter_plan drops the Fit/Crop override
  when a layout template is set.
- CLIP_MIN_SECONDS (default 17) floor in create_optimized_clip.
- seam_red: black outline (red only on the divider); the seam caption
  style applies only when the stack is used. Pin updated in
  test_gaming_templates (owner change, explained in the test).
- tasks.hook_title_enabled (nullable, NULL = on) + API + create form
  "Title on clips" switch; off burns no title.
- Create page: one Layout picker with drawn example pictures (Auto,
  Face on top red/gold, Full screen, Crop) replacing the Framing toggle
  and the gaming-only layout row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
